.DS_Store
development/
overlays/

# Machine-owned files — written by `omanix state set` / `omanix update`, never hand-edited.
# `state.nix` is deliberately NOT ignored: Nix flakes only copy tracked files into the
# build source, and configuration.nix imports ./state.nix — an ignored/untracked
# state.nix would be missing from every build. Machine edits to the tracked state.nix
# are safe: `omanix update` autostashes + restores them, `state prune` drops stale keys,
# and the script aborts before rebuild if a resolution is ever pending.
# `version` is ignored (read by the update script only, never imported at eval).
version